WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.450
Real recording: OpenAI Realtime (gpt-realtime-2), Mandarin, translated captions.

2
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:03.200
The customer taps Talk and accepts the one-time voice notice.

3
00:00:03.250 --> 00:00:05.450
[Connecting. The customer voice in this demo is synthetic text-to-speech.]

4
00:00:05.520 --> 00:00:08.920
Waiter: Hi, welcome to Xiangkou Diner! What would you like to start with?

5
00:00:09.920 --> 00:00:14.470
Customer (TTS): Hi, I would like a bowl of braised beef noodle soup, mildly spicy, with wide noodles.

6
00:00:14.840 --> 00:00:17.590
[The model calls add_items; the server checks it against the menu and the ticket updates.]

7
00:00:17.660 --> 00:00:22.680
Waiter: One braised beef noodle soup, mild, wide noodles, done. Anything else?

8
00:00:23.680 --> 00:00:26.800
Customer (TTS): And a bubble milk tea, less ice, half sugar.

9
00:00:28.700 --> 00:00:32.140
Waiter: OK, let me check the bubble milk tea options first.

10
00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:39.220
Waiter: The bubble milk tea needs a size first: medium or large? Once you choose I will add it. Less ice, half sugar is fine.

11
00:00:40.220 --> 00:00:41.520
Customer (TTS): Large, thanks.

12
00:00:41.920 --> 00:00:45.170
[add_items: bubble milk tea, large, less ice, half sugar. Validated server-side.]

13
00:00:45.250 --> 00:00:48.440
Waiter: Large bubble milk tea, less ice, half sugar, added.

14
00:00:48.960 --> 00:00:53.080
Waiter: Your subtotal is NT$255. Would you like to check out?

15
00:00:54.080 --> 00:00:57.560
Customer (TTS): Add one braised egg too. That is all, please check me out.

16
00:00:59.840 --> 00:01:03.780
Waiter: Sure, I will add the braised egg, then confirm your order.

17
00:01:04.220 --> 00:01:11.600
Waiter: You ordered one braised beef noodle soup, mild, wide noodles; one large bubble milk tea, less ice, half sugar; and one braised egg. NT$270 in total.

18
00:01:11.970 --> 00:01:16.820
Waiter: Please tap the submit button on the screen to finish checking out.

19
00:01:16.880 --> 00:01:17.570
[confirm_order returned the server-computed total.]

20
00:01:17.590 --> 00:01:20.780
The customer taps Confirm order, enters table 5 and submits.

21
00:01:20.820 --> 00:01:23.670
Order #001 is placed: dine-in, table 5, NT$270.

22
00:01:23.690 --> 00:01:26.660
Kitchen display: order #001 arrives under New, tagged Voice.

23
00:01:26.710 --> 00:01:29.830
The kitchen taps Start. The order moves to In progress.
